<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Designed by Jim Perkins Copyright September 7, 2002</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Designed for Greensboro Gem &amp; Mineral Club.</text>
